">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(w,b) = \\frac{1}{2m} \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( f_{w,b}(x^{(i)}) - y^{(i)} \\right)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"0\">Read</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"1\">it</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"2\">from</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"4\">inside</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"5\">out:</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"7\">error</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"9\">example</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"10\">i,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"11\">squared,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"12\">added</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"13\">over</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"14\">all</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"15\">m</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"16\">examples,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"17\">divided</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"18\">by</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"19\">m</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"20\">to</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"21\">get</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"22\">an</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"23\">average</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"24\">(so</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"25\">that</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"26\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"27\">number</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"28\">does</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"29\">not</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"30\">grow</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"31\">just</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"32\">because</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"33\">you</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"34\">have</span> <