 <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"8\">(3,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"9\">3)</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"11\">fix</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"12\">b</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"13\">=</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"14\">0,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"15\">so</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"17\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"18\">depends</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"19\">only</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"20\">on</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"21\">w.</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"22\">For</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"23\">w</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"24\">=</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"25\">0.5:</span></p>\n<p><span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"0\">J</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"1\">=</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"2\">1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"3\">/</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"4\">(2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"5\">x</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"6\">3)</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"7\">x</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"8\">(</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"9\">(0.5</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"10\">-</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"11\">1)^2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"12\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"13\">(1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"14\">-</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"15\">2)^2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"16\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"17\">(1.5</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"18\">-</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"19\">3)^2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"20\">)</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"21\">=</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"22\">(0.25</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"23\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"24\">1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"25\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"26\">2.25)</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"27\">/</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"28\">6</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"29\">=</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"30\">0.583</span></p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>w</th>\n<th>The line</th>\n<th>Cost J(w)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Goes through every point</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>Too flat</td>\n<td>0.583</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>Flat at zero</td>\n<td>2.333</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"0\">Plot</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"1\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"2\">against</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"3\">w</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"6\">get</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"7\">a</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"8\">parabola</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"9\">(a</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"10\">U</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"11\">shape)</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"12\">whose</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"13\">lowest</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"14\">point</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"15\">is</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"16\">at</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"17\">w</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"18\">=</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"19\">1.</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"1\">goal</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"3\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"4\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"7\">find</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"9\">w</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"11\">b</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"12\">that</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"13\">sit</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"14\">at</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"16\">bottom.</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nx = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\ny = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n\ndef cost(w, b):\n    return np.sum((w * x + b - y) ** 2) / (2 * len(x))\n\nprint(cost(1, 0), round(cost(0.5, 0), 3), round(cost(0, 0), 3))   # 0.0 0.583 2.333\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"h-53-seeing-the-bowl\"><span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"0\">5.3</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"1\">Seeing</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"3\">bowl</span></h4>\n<p><span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"0\">With</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"1\">both</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"2\">w</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"3\">and</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"4\">b</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"5\">free,</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"6\">J</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"8\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"9\">surface</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"10\">over</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"11\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"12\">plane:</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"13\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"14\">bowl,</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"15\">like</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"17\">soup</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"18\">bowl</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"19\">or</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"20\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"21\">hammock.</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <strong><span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"1\">contour</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"2\">plot</span></strong> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"3\">shows</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"5\">same</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"6\">bowl</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"7\">from</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"8\">above,</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"9\">like</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"11\">topographic</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"12\">map:</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"13\">every</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"14\">ring</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"15\">is</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"17\">set</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"18\">of</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"19\">(w,</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"20\">b)</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"21\">pairs</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"22\">with</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"23\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"24\">same</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"25\">cost,</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"26\">and</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"27\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"28\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"29\">is</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"30\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"31\">minimum.</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"0\">In</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"1\">Ng's</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"2\">housing</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"3\">example</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"5\">point</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"6\">far</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"7\">from</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"9\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"10\">(w</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"11\">about</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"12\">-0.15,</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"13\">b</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"14\">about</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"15\">800)</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"16\">is</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"17\">a</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"18\">very</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"19\">bad</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"20\">line,</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"21\">while</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"22\">points</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"23\">near</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"24\">the</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"25\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"26\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"27\">well.</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"0\">Reading</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"1\">such</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"2\">plots</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"3\">by</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"4\">hand</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"5\">does</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"6\">not</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"7\">scale,</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"8\">so</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"9\">we</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"10\">need</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"11\">an</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"12\">algorithm</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"13\">that</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"14\">walks</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"15\">to</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"17\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"18\">by</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"19\">itself.</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"0\">That</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"2\">gradient</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"3\">descent.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-54-convex-one-bottom-no-traps\"><span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"0\">5.4</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"1\">Convex:</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"2\">one</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"3\">bottom,</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"4\">no</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"5\">traps</span></h4>\n<p><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"1\">squared-error</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"2\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"4\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"5\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"6\">is</span> <strong><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"7\">convex</span></strong><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"7\">:</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"8\">one</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"9\">bowl,</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"10\">one</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"11\">lowest</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"12\">point,</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"13\">no</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"14\">side</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"15\">valleys.</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"0\">Wherever</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"1\">you</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"2\">start,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"3\">going</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"4\">downhill</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"5\">ends</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"6\">at</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"8\">global</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"9\">minimum.</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"1\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"2\">surface</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"5\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"6\">network</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"8\">not</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"9\">convex.</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"1\">has</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"2\">many</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"3\">valleys</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"4\">(local</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"5\">minima),</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"7\">where</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"8\">training</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"9\">ends</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"10\">depends</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"11\">on</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"12\">where</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"13\">it</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"14\">started.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-55-other-ways-to-measure-error\"><span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"0\">5.5</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"1\">Other</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"2\">ways</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"4\">measure</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"5\">error</span></h4>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"0\">Beyond</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"2\">videos.</span></em> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"1\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"2\">error</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"5\">standard</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"6\">choice,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"7\">but</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"8\">there</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"9\">are</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"10\">others,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"12\">you</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"13\">will</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"14\">meet</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"15\">these</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"16\">names:</span></p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Measure</th>\n<th>Formula in words</th>\n<th>Notes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>MSE (mean squared error)</td>\n<td>average of the squared errors</td>\n<td>the cost J without the 1/2: here 2 x 0.583 = 1.167</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMSE</td>\n<td>square root of the MSE</td>\n<td>same units as y, so easier to explain: 1.08 here</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAE (mean absolute error)</td>\n<td>average of the absolute errors</td>\n<td>treats all errors alike, less hurt by outliers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R squared</td>\n<td>1 minus (error around the fit) / (error around the mean)</td>\n<td>1 is perfect, 0 is no better than always guessing the average</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"1\">bank</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"2\">manager</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"3\">understands</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"4\">\"typically</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"5\">wrong</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"6\">by</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"7\">22</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"8\">euros</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"10\">month\"</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"11\">(RMSE)</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"12\">better</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"13\">than</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"14\">\"mean</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"15\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"16\">error</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"17\">480\".</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"0\">Loan</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"1\">example.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"0\">Take</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"2\">monthly</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"4\">of</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"5\">each</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"6\">offer.</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"1\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"2\">J</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"3\">measures</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"4\">how</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"5\">far,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"6\">on</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"7\">average</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"9\">squared,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"11\">predicted</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"12\">monthly</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"13\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"14\">is</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"15\">from</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"17\">real</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"18\">one.</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"0\">One</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"1\">outlier</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"2\">offer</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"3\">with</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"5\">500</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"6\">euro</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"7\">error</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"8\">adds</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"9\">as</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"10\">much</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"11\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"12\">error</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"13\">as</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"14\">25</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"15\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"16\">with</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"17\">a</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"18\">100</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"19\">euro</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"20\">error.</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"0\">Check</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"1\">whether</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"4\">what</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"6\">want,</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"7\">because</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"8\">it</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"9\">decides</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"10\">whether</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"11\">MSE</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"12\">or</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"13\">MAE</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"14\">suits</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"16\">business.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"0\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"1\">mistakes</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"0\">Comparing</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"2\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"4\">two</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"5\">models</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"6\">on</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"7\">different</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"8\">datasets,</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"9\">or</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"10\">one</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"11\">on</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"12\">training</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"13\">and</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"14\">one</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"15\">on</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"16\">test</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"17\">data.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"0\">Forgetting</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"1\">that</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"4\">depends</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"5\">on</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"7\">units</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"9\">y.</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"10\">A</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"11\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"12\">of</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"13\">480</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"14\">is</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"15\">large</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"16\">for</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"17\">prices</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"18\">in</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"19\">dollars</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"20\">and</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"21\">tiny</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"22\">for</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"23\">prices</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"24\">in</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"25\">cents.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"0\">Believing</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"2\">low</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"4\">proves</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"6\">model</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"8\">good.</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"1\">might</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"2\">simply</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"3\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"5\">training</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"6\">data</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"7\">too</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"8\">closely</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"9\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"10\">11).</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Check yourself</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compute J for the points (1, 2), (2, 4) and w = 2, b = 0.</li>\n<li>Why divide by m? Why divide by 2?</li>\n<li>What does convex mean, and why is it good news?</li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"answers\"><summary>Show answers</summary><p> (1) The line predicts 2 and 4, the errors are 0, so J = 0. (2) Dividing by m makes the cost an average that does not depend on the amount of data; the 2 only cancels the 2 from the derivative. (3) The cost has one bottom and no false valleys, so downhill always ends at the best solution.</p></details>\n<p><strong>Go deeper:</strong> Ng, course 1, videos 11 to 14 · Google's <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/machine-learning/crash-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Linear regression</a> module in the crash course · the scikit-learn page on <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/model_evaluation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">model evaluation</a> for the other error measures.</p>\n"}